Email Sync for Bank Transactions (Phase 1)

🎯 Objective
Enable users to fetch their bank-related emails from Gmail within a selected date range and display/log the raw email content.

👤 User Story
As a user,
I want to click a “Sync Emails” button,
Select a date range,
So that I can fetch my bank transaction emails automatically instead of manually checking Gmail.


✅ Scope (Phase 1 ONLY)

✔ Google authenticated users
✔ Use Gmail access permission (already granted)
✔ Fetch emails using:

sender (bank emails)
date range

✔ Display / log:

email subject
email body

🎯 Success Criteria
User clicks sync
Emails are fetched successfully
Console logs show:
subject
body

